<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND CHILE DREW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND CHILE DREW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia and Chile drew 1-1 (halftime 1-1) in a South American World Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bolivia - Vladimir Soria (27th minute)</p>
<p>Chile - Pedro Gonzalez (45th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
